### Fetch all banks 
GET https://pluginapi.onrender.com/api/account/banks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY3MjZhOWI4ZmNjZDk0OTdhNTFjMjVkOSIsImVtYWlsIjoiZWhtYWVzc2llbkBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3MzU4Mjg4NTQsImV4cCI6MTczODQyMDg1NH0.tcUbqY7ImJqNSwxT5tI3AzXftYzq6iwOuZZrsAZPqdg

